OL,3,GNEWSAPeople 'terrified' to go into town
OL,4,Acentre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spate of antisocial behaviour has
OL,7,Fleft people "terrified" of going into a
OL,8,Ftown centre, a local councillor has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FConsett residents have been reporting
OL,12,Ffights and businesses' back yards being
OL,13,Fused as "toilets" in the area around
OL,14,Fthe town centre and the bus station.
OL,16,FCounty councillor Kathryn Rooney said
OL,17,Felderly people felt "very intimidated"
OL,18,Fand said she was worried they would
OL,19,Fbecome isolated.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
