OL,3,GNEWSAPeople 'terrified' to go into town
OL,4,Acentre
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform-run Durham County Council said
OL,7,Fit took antisocial behaviour
OL,8,F"seriously" and its cabinet would
OL,9,Fconsider introducing a Public Space
OL,10,FProtection Order in the town centre and
OL,11,Fbus station next week.
